  "reasoning": "The facts describe that the defendant, 严某某, after learning of a violent assault on a school security guard, actively assisted the attackers by providing transportation (riding a motorcycle to the scene, later driving a car) and later helping them hide in a village. This conduct constitutes the crime of harboring and sheltering fugitives, i.e., \"窝藏、包庇\" under Chinese criminal law. No other distinct criminal conduct (such as the assault itself) is attributed to 严某某, so the appropriate charge is solely the crime of harboring/assisting fugitives.",
